~ convo_1
Az: I don't mean to be rude, but... why are you here?
Fenn: What do you mean?
Az: In the palace?
Fenn: I was invited!! King Oakley sent a letter to me personally. He said he was looking for candidates for new Knights! 
Az: Seriously?
Fenn: Yeah! 
Az: He reached out to you? A kid?
Fenn: Yup. He was super impressed with how much I knew about the other Knights, he just had to invite me to the castle.
Az: Hmph. Alright.
=> END

~ convo_2
Fenn: Do you like living at the palace?
Az: Eh. It's cool, I guess. I got my own workshop in the cellar, plenty of stuff to tinker with, all the time in the world.
Az: Not the same as home, though.
Fenn: Kuva, right?
Az: Yeah... how'd you know?
Fenn: It's in your biography at the Grasen History Museum!
Az: Ah... right. 
Fenn: You grew up on Straw Ave, had two best friends, and won crafts shows before getting into smithing! Oh and also, that one ti-
Az: Okay! Okay, that's enough out of you, kid.
=> END

~ convo_3
Az: Where are you from?
Fenn: Navetta!
Az: Hm. Never heard of it. Where is it?
Fenn: It's north. Lots of trees and farms and stuff.
Az: Ah, the countryside?
Fenn: Yeah... it's kinda boring.
=> END

~ convo_4
Fenn: Do you make a lot of bracelet things?
Az: Bangles?
Fenn: Yeah, bracelet things.
Az: No, not often. These ones took me weeks to get the inscriptions right.
Az: If I want something for my wrists, I usually make bracelets with yarn or beads
Fenn: That's so cool! Could I have one?
Az: Well, yeah sure. They're in my room, though.
Fenn: Yippee! I can't wait
=> END

~ convo_5
Az: How come you seem to know a lot about the Knights and stuff?
Fenn: Who wouldn't want to know about the knights? They're the coolest!
Az: I dunno. I've never seen someone so... enthusiastic about them.
Fenn: But they do so many awesome things! They go on adventures! Slay monsters! Save princesses!
Az: Kid, I don't think there's been a princess that needed saving in like at least a century
Fenn: But... but...
Az: Nah. Don't worry, kid. I get it.
Az: I remember when Baba became a Knight. It was pretty cool.
=> END

~ convo_6
Fenn: Have you met Adira? Knight of Cloth? She's my favorite Knight. She's so cool!!!!
Az: Adira? Yikes...
Fenn: Why? What? What's wrong with Adira?
Az: I mean...nothing... if you don't mind Knights who are a shallow, conceited, piece of-
Fenn: WHAT?!
Az: Sorry to break it to you, kid. Adira is... kinda terrible.
Fenn: But... but...
Az: Hey, don't worry about it. Most of 'em are fine. Adira specifically is terrible.
Fenn: Aww...
=> END

~ convo_7
Fenn: Who's your favorite Knight? Like, besides your Dad?
Az: Hmm... besides Baba? I haven't really spent time with a lot of them.
Az: Henric and Ophelia are a little intense. I'd say Maysa probably. She's chill.
Fenn: Oooh, good choice. I think I have a few Maysas. Mostly Adira and Henric full-arts.
Az: Are you talking about trading cards?
Fenn: Yeah I have a ton of them!
Az: Huh... I didn't know there were trading cards for the Knights.
Fenn: They don't!
Az:Ah...
=> END